-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- identification, compiled
-- A text read forward and written as its key (lc 1: letters lowercase) or its forms (lc 0), consed as it
-- is read, so the list comes reversed. The state: 1 in a separation, 2 a newline in it (the start of a
-- text counts as one), 4 × the dashes held at the start of a word, which are the comment mark when a
-- separation with a newline comes before them and one after, and a word of dashes, or the start of a word,
-- otherwise.
nm-ws : Word → Bool
nm-ws c = orB (weq c #32) (orB (weq c #10) (orB (weq c #9) (weq c #13)))
